                  },
                  {
                    "name": "body",
                    "type": "TEXT",
                    "visible": true,
                    "characters": "Beginners are always welcome! No dance experience, registration, or partner is needed. We frequently rotate partners in class, so just bring yourself :). We're open to all Stanford affiliates.\nWear comfortable clothes that let you move freely, and bring socks or non-marking dance shoes/sneakers. Come learn, meet people, and enjoy dancing!",
